		"note_1": "The Wall began to fall one morning, without warning. No one noticed the hole in the sky.",
		"note_2": "The first keeper was born the day the Wall touched the ground.",
		"note_3": "The more you break it, the more the Wall resembles its breaker. So someone wrote.",
		"note_4": "Who made the ball? Nowhere in these notes is there an answer.",
		"note_5": "None of Gantetsu's men are alive. He knows that.",
		"note_6": "Every morning in Lumina's castle, a table is laid for no one.",
		"note_7": "The moment Chrono rewinds is the moment just before it parted from a friend.",
		"note_8": "Old Dokan's last firework has yet to be seen by anyone.",
		"note_9": "Each time Homura takes flight, the hole in the sky grows a little wider.",
		"note_10": "The Void has no eye of its own. Someone on the other side looks through it.",
		"note_11": "Someone broke the Wall first. They went on through the hole, and never returned.",
		"note_12": "You who have beaten every keeper: past the hole, the first Breaker is waiting.",
		"ending_1": "The first Breaker quietly crumbled.",
		"ending_2": "In its hand was a ball, just like yours.",
		"ending_3": "It went through the hole to end the Wall.",
		"ending_4": "It could not, and in time it became the Wall.",
		"ending_5": "Slowly, the hole in the sky closes.",
		"ending_6": "For the first time, the falling stops.",
		"ending_7": "But the ball in your hand is still warm.",
		"ending_8": "Somewhere, the next wall may already be falling.",
