		"boss_purun_lore": "The youngest keeper, first born of the Wall. It loves multiplying when struck, and hasn't yet realised it is guarding anything.",
		"boss_mogu_lore": "A hero once, who vowed to eat the Wall away. The more it ate the hungrier it grew, and now it has forgotten why it started.",
		"boss_gantetsu_lore": "A captain who shielded his men to the last as his fort fell. Swallowed by the Wall, he still calls the roll each morning.",
		"boss_dokan_lore": "He made fireworks for the festivals. Since the Wall took the sky, he has been looking for somewhere to light up the night again.",
		"boss_lumina_lore": "A queen who ruled through healing. Long after her people left she kept mending the castle, until the gift became a curse.",
		"boss_zero_lore": "The last weapon built to break the Wall. Whoever gave the orders is gone, so anything that moves is now a target.",
		"boss_mirage_lore": "A dancer born from a reflection in the Wall's cracks. Even she doesn't know where the real one is.",
		"boss_chrono_lore": "A clockmaker's final work, meant to bring back the world before the Wall. It can only rewind a moment, and repeats that moment forever.",
		"boss_hyoga_lore": "A lone wolf who stopped the Wall at the edge of the north. The price was freezing along with it.",
		"boss_homura_lore": "A phoenix reborn from its ashes each time it burns out. However often it falls, it believes the next flight will reach the sky.",
		"boss_tsukuyo_lore": "A princess who claims to be the very moon hidden behind the Wall. Only her waxing, waning light shows what she feels.",
		"boss_void_lore": "The hole in the sky that every wall falls from. All the keepers were called here. No one has seen what lies beyond it.",
		"boss_mirage_name": "MIRAGE",
		"boss_mirage_title": "THE PHANTOM DANCER",
